  "prefLabel": "Bar 603.04 Complaints of Misconduct",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Bar 603.04 Complaints of Misconduct. Individuals wishing to file an official complaint against a licensee or against a person believed to be engaging in a regulated profession without the requisite license shall do so by submitting a written complaint as required by Plc 204.02 and Plc 204.03.\n\nSource. #8444, eff 10-06-05, EXPIRED: 10-6-13\n\nNew. #10808, eff 4-2-15, EXPIRED: 4-1-25\n\nNew. #14271, INTERIM, eff 6-16-25, EXPIRES: 12-14-25; ss by #14591, eff 7-17-26, EXPIRES: 7-17-36",
